    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just burnout. i look at them and i just see how much harder their lives are because i'm here. the bills, the constant stress i bring home... if i wasn't around, maybe they could actually breathe. maybe they could find some peace without having to worry about me all the time. it feels like the only way i can actually help them is by not being there.",
